Third-party work this project builds on (protocol knowledge, ported to Rust):

- khoanguyen-3fc/dh-p2p — Easy4ip handshake and PTCP description
  https://github.com/khoanguyen-3fc/dh-p2p  (MIT License, Copyright (c) 2023 khoanguyen-3fc)
- ludufre/dahua-p2p — reliable PTCP layer, relay session behaviour, RTSP client
  https://github.com/ludufre/dahua-p2p  (declared MIT in its package.json; its README
  asks for personal / research, non-commercial use, which this project follows)
